 sister, Akari, was subjected to horrific bullying in this town and took her own life. Mei has returned to exact revenge. She plans to perform the blood-soaked ritual ‘Okakashitsutsumi,’ handed down at Akada Shrine, to embody the giant serpent god ‘Okakashisama’ and kill the seven people involved.\n\nOn the night of the summer solstice, Mei successfully performs the ritual. From that point on, with the power of the god and together with Shiori, Mei begins to kill those involved in her sister’s death, one by one each day. Amid their days of vengeance and escape, the two eventually develop romantic feelings for each other. However, Mei keeps one secret from Shiori: anyone who performs the ‘Okakashitsutsumi’ must ultimately offer their soul to the god, meaning Mei’s own death is inevitable.","year":2025,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Drama","Tragedy"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/79817845-5242-4ec2-8408-5c373cf411ad/876c4e44-fd15-42cd-b04e-5e4a8cd81cc1.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["ru","en","vi"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.26,"follows":7573,"listAt":"2026-10-27T12:20:34.023Z","chapters":[{"id":"632add2b-6a86-420d-b048-4a4a4cc10f34","number":"11","volume":"3","title":"Shiori Can't Accept it","lang":"en","pages":38,"createdAt":"2026-10-24T22:58:34+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d1998834-1d4b-416e-90c1-d9218398a435","number":"10","volume":"2","title":"Murderer","lang":"en","pages":42,"createdAt":"2026-07-21T06:33:03+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"dad00903-f8bb-4b91-a0df-14ac774c8e1c","number":"9","volume":"2","title":"Reminiscence","lang":"en","pages":33,"createdAt":"2026-05-14T08:30:30+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"87b4339c-b130-4ff5-84b7-b68833fa383f","number":"8","volume":"2","title":"Pure Evil","lang":"en","pages":34,"createdAt":"2026-05-13T01:35:48+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"8fad4614-f6cd-4e9a-890d-c8548a3ab982","number":"7","volume":"2","title":"Akari's Plea","lang":"en","pag